{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1250\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Calibri;}}\f0\fs22 Advok\u225?tska kancel\u225?ria Hoferov\u225? & Barto\u353? s. r. o.\par Laurinsk\u225? 12, 811 01 Bratislava\par I\u268?O 51 234 567 \u183? DI\u268? 2120123456 \u183? I\u268? DPH SK2120123456 \u183? SAK 1847\par \par document retention\par 12. 3. 2026\par \par Document retention (LEG-RET-05)\par \par Issuer: Advok\u225?tska kancel\u225?ria Hoferov\u225? & Barto\u353? s. r. o. \u183? I\u268?O 51 234 567 \u183? Laurinsk\u225? 12, 811 01 Bratislava\par \par A closed matter file is retained for at least 10 years from the end of the engagement, matching the accounting retention period in z\u225?kon \u269?. 431/2002 Z. z. and the Bar's records rules; a longer statutory period wins where one applies.\par Original deeds, wills and share certificates are logged in the custody register kept in the Bratislava office safe.\par A client may ask for originals back at any time; the firm keeps certified copies according to the retention schedule.\par Personal data is deleted once the retention period ends, in line with GDPR and z\u225?kon \u269?. 18/2018 Z. z.\par Destruction requires a destruction certificate and an update to the conflicts archive, so future conflict checks still find the matter.\par \par \par Mgr. Jana Hoferov\u225?, advok\u225?tka, konate\u318?ka}